AB  - BACKGROUND: Chemotherapy-induced nausea and vomiting (CINV) remains a major burden. This randomized trial evaluated acupuncture as an adjunct in lung cancer patients. METHODS: 120 patients were randomized to acupuncture plus standard antiemetics or antiemetics alone. RESULTS: The acupuncture group showed significantly lower CINV incidence.
