AB  - OBJECTIVE: To assess moxibustion for cancer-related fatigue (CRF) in lung cancer. METHODS: Eight databases were searched. Nine RCTs with 712 participants were included. RESULTS: Moxibustion reduced Piper Fatigue Scale scores.
